src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-137-      <section id="unknowns">
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-138-        <p class="sec-kicker" data-layer="narrative">Open questions</p>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-139-        <h2 data-layer="fact">What we do not know yet</h2>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-140-        <ul data-layer="fact">
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:141:          <li data-absence>Whether the September 23 status report was filed, and whether the initial safety closure was extended. Searched: the admitted docket material and coverage through September 19; the report was not yet due.</li>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:142:          <li data-absence>Whether the defendants have developed a project-scope change that would trigger the notice order. The accessible public filings through September 19 do not identify an approved demolition plan. Floca's declaration identifies an earlier JLL report and Delta presentation filed under seal. It says the finalized Delta report and certain appendices were filed as Exhibit A, but that exhibit did not answer through the public docket route.</li>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:143:          <li data-absence>Which closure condition appears in the September 15 preliminary minutes. The two defense filings quote the resolution differently, and the preliminary minutes were not available through the public docket route.</li>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-144-          <li>Trump's intent remained unresolved on September 18. The Associated Press reported that he did not directly respond when asked whether he planned to demolish the theater.<Cite s="ap-trump-kennedy-center-2026-09-18" passage="did not directly respond when a reporter asked whether he planned to demolish the theater" /></li>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro:145:          <li data-absence>The court's minute order as a standalone, court-hosted document. Searched: the District Court docket, CourtListener and Justia; the docket routes were unavailable to the capture registry and the Justia mirror stopped before September 17. The page therefore labels the carriers of the quoted sentence.</li>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-146-        </ul>
src/pages/events/kennedy-center/2026-09-17-30-day-notice-before-demolition.astro-147-      </section>
