A motion was called to approve the minutes of the June 11, 2026 Board of Trustees meeting.

Representative Rick Larsen noted several typographical errors for staff to correct, and further noted that
the formal name of the subcommittee that dealt with the reconciliation bill (referenced on p. 8) was
stated improperly. Rep. Larsen advised that the correct formal name is the Subcommittee on Economic
